(10985, 1, '2024-08-08 07:14:33', '2024-08-08 07:14:33', 'EXCLUSIVE ACCESS<h1\n			>Empowering your vision — when you\'re inside</h1><p>Once admitted to Visionity, your company unlocks a reserved ecosystem designed around your structure and industry.<br />\nWhat you access:</p>\n					<h4><a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/strategy-consulting/\">\n                                    Tailored Funding Programs                                    </a></h4>Filtered by your sector, delivered by your dedicated consultant<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/strategy-consulting/\"\n                       >\n                        </a><h4><a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/financial-advisory/\">\n                                    Dedicated Sector Specialist                                    </a></h4>Your single point of contact for strategy, incentives, and updates<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/financial-advisory/\"\n                       >\n                        </a><h4><a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/market-research/\">\n                                    Reserved Digital Platform                                    </a></h4>Access opportunities, track your projects, and connect with verified experts<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/market-research/\"\n                       >\n                        </a><h4><a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/leadership-coaching/\">\n                                    Evolving Support                                    </a></h4>We align our services to your growth, with continuous strategic updates<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/leadership-coaching/\"\n                       >\n                        </a><!-- /.sc_icons -->				\n					MEMBERSHIP ACCESS<h1\n			>Strategic growth, by invitation only</h1><p>Once admitted, Visionity becomes your private gateway to structured evolution.</p>\n		<ul><li><p>Curated funding opportunities, tailored to your sector and profile</p></li><li><p>Direct access to a dedicated strategic advisor</p></li><li><p>Reserved digital platform for real-time project visibility</p></li><li><p>Discreet, evolving support aligned with your growth path</p></li></ul>		\n					<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/about-us/\" >Access Your Area</a>				\n					WHAT YOU ACCESS<h1\n			>Curated resources, aligned to your structure</h1>				\n					<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/estate-planning/\"\n	class=\"sc_cover sc_cover_default\"\n	data-place=\"row\" ></a>				\n					<h2>01</h2>				\n					<h3\n			>Sector-Specific Opportunities</h3>				\n		<p>We identify and activate national and EU funding — precisely matched to your model and market.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/our-services/\">\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"34.356\" height=\"23.642\" viewBox=\"0 0 34.356 23.642\"><path d=\"M33.888,52.608,23.664,42.384A1.6,1.6,0,1,0,21.4,44.643l7.5,7.5H1.6a1.6,1.6,0,0,0,0,3.195H28.9l-7.5,7.5a1.6,1.6,0,0,0,2.259,2.259L33.888,54.867A1.6,1.6,0,0,0,33.888,52.608Z\" transform=\"translate(0 -41.916)\"></path></svg>			</a>\n					<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/tax-planning/\"\n	class=\"sc_cover sc_cover_default\"\n	data-place=\"row\" ></a>				\n					<h2>02</h2>				\n					<h3\n			>Dedicated Strategic Advisor</h3>				\n		<p>One point of contact. For strategy, progress, and continuity.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/our-services/\">\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"34.356\" height=\"23.642\" viewBox=\"0 0 34.356 23.642\"><path d=\"M33.888,52.608,23.664,42.384A1.6,1.6,0,1,0,21.4,44.643l7.5,7.5H1.6a1.6,1.6,0,0,0,0,3.195H28.9l-7.5,7.5a1.6,1.6,0,0,0,2.259,2.259L33.888,54.867A1.6,1.6,0,0,0,33.888,52.608Z\" transform=\"translate(0 -41.916)\"></path></svg>			</a>\n					<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/services/insurance-planning/\"\n	class=\"sc_cover sc_cover_default\"\n	data-place=\"row\" ></a>				\n					<h2>03</h2>				\n					<h3\n			>Reserved Digital Platform</h3>				\n		<p>Monitor projects, discover new pathways, and access tools — exclusively within your private space.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/our-services/\">\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"34.356\" height=\"23.642\" viewBox=\"0 0 34.356 23.642\"><path d=\"M33.888,52.608,23.664,42.384A1.6,1.6,0,1,0,21.4,44.643l7.5,7.5H1.6a1.6,1.6,0,0,0,0,3.195H28.9l-7.5,7.5a1.6,1.6,0,0,0,2.259,2.259L33.888,54.867A1.6,1.6,0,0,0,33.888,52.608Z\" transform=\"translate(0 -41.916)\"></path></svg>			</a>\n															<img width=\"140\" height=\"69\" src=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/client18-copyright.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"140\" height=\"69\" src=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/client13-copyright.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"140\" height=\"69\" src=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/client14-copyright.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"140\" height=\"69\" src=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/client15-copyright.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"140\" height=\"69\" src=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/client16-copyright.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"140\" height=\"69\" src=\"https://test100.afterbit.it/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/client17-copyright.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<h5\n			>Check our top clients & partners</h5>				\n			<a href=\"#popup-video\">\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 12\"><path d=\"M8.163 5.38849L0.419001 0.0474896C0.378906 0.0197263 0.331974 0.00347451 0.283297 0.000497888C0.234619 -0.00247874 0.186057 0.0079335 0.142879 0.0306046C0.0997003 0.0532758 0.063556 0.0873398 0.0383682 0.1291C0.0131804 0.17086 -8.89579e-05 0.218721 4.48836e-07 0.26749V10.9485C-8.89579e-05 10.9973 0.0131804 11.0451 0.0383682 11.0869C0.063556 11.1286 0.0997003 11.1627 0.142879 11.1854C0.186057 11.208 0.234619 11.2185 0.283297 11.2155C0.331974 11.2125 0.378906 11.1963 0.419001 11.1685L8.163 5.82749C8.19868 5.80295 8.22786 5.7701 8.24802 5.73178C8.26818 5.69345 8.27871 5.65079 8.27871 5.60749C8.27871 5.56418 8.26818 5.52153 8.24802 5.4832C8.22786 5.44488 8.19868 5.41303 8.163 5.38849Z\"></path></svg>			</a>\n					<p>Layouts: Popup</p>				\n					<h1\n			>We don’t follow opportunities.\nWe build the conditions to create them.\n</h1>', 'services', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'services-2-2', '', '', '2025-07-22 10:05:07', '2025-07-22 10:05:07', '', 0, 'https://test100.afterbit.it/?page_id=10985', 0, 'page', '', 0),
